  35:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c **** 
  36:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c **** /**
  37:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * @brief Processing function for the Q31 DCT4/IDCT4.
  38:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * @param[in]       *S             points to an instance of the Q31 DCT4 structure.
  39:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * @param[in]       *pState        points to state buffer.
  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * @param[in,out]   *pInlineBuffer points to the in-place input and output buffer.
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * @return none.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * \par Input an output formats:
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * Input samples need to be downscaled by 1 bit to avoid saturations in the Q31 DCT process,
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * as the conversion from DCT2 to DCT4 involves one subtraction.
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * Internally inputs are downscaled in the RFFT process function to avoid overflows.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * Number of bits downscaled, depends on the size of the transform.
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * The input and output formats for different DCT sizes and number of bits to upscale are mentioned
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  *
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  * \image html dct4FormatsQ31Table.gif
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c ****  */
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c **** 
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q31.c **** void arm_dct4_q31(
